  "description": "“Do you think you're allowed to play billiards?” Taeyoon has stayed away from the sport for the past five years following the death of his uncle, a professional player. Picking up a cue again by chance, he finds it surprisingly effortless and actually fun. However, he must not let his family find out. As he enjoys playing more, a question suddenly crosses his mind. Will Taeyoon be able to continue playing billiards?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=853092), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14507202)",
